                <div class="rule-content">
                    <span class="rule-badge">02</span>
                    <h3>Default to Transparency</h3>
                    <p>Share context, not just conclusions. When people understand the "why," they make better decisions without asking permission.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Rule 3 -->
